---

This project is an Electron shell and UI enhancement layer built on top of:

  w-okada/voice-changer — https://github.com/w-okada/voice-changer

The underlying AI voice conversion engine, voice models, and Python backend
are subject to their own respective licenses as published in the original
repository. This MIT license covers only the Electron shell code and UI
modifications contained in this repository (main.js, start.js, and the
dist/web_front/modern-ui.* files).
